# Lucciola's login screen is greetd (with Noctalia Greeter). GDM stays
# installed, disabled, as the fallback greetd.service starts when it fails
# (greetd.service.d/50-lucciola.conf). Read before Fedora's
# 85-display-manager.preset, which enables gdm.service.
enable greetd.service
disable gdm.service
